<title>USA: TransTechnology Q3 EPS $0.56-shr vs $0.46.</title>
<headline>TransTechnology Q3 EPS $0.56-shr vs $0.46.</headline>
<dateline>LIBERTY CORNER, N.J. 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr primary     $0.56		    $0.46</p>
<p> Net		 2,821		    2,346</p>
<p> Revs		42,851		   41,087</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary5,026,000		5,099,000</p>
<p>		MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr primary     $1.22		    $1.00</p>
<p> Net		 6,170		    5,101</p>
<p> Revs		131,071		  111,155</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary5,076,000		5,092,000</p>
<p>(All data in 000s except per share numbers. The 1996 third-quarter includes a charge of $0.04 per share for discontinued operations. The 1995 third-quarter included a charge of $0.09 per share for discontinued operations.</p>
<p>Excluding the charges, the company had earnings from continued operations of $0.60 per share in the third-quarter of 1996, compared with $0.55 per share in the year-earlier period. The company's full name is TransTechnology Corp.</p>
</text>
